 Version 2.0, like the rest of Sysbox.
 .
 The sysbox-fs, sysbox-mgr and sysbox-runc binaries are statically linked
 with the GNU C Library (LGPL-2.1-or-later), and sysbox-fs and sysbox-runc
 also with libseccomp (LGPL-2.1-only). STATIC-LINKING.md in this directory
 gives the library versions, where to get their source and how to relink.
 The Go modules compiled into the binaries and their licences are listed in
 OSS_DISCLOSURES.md in this directory.
